    {
        "text": "What's going on...? ! Why... Why is Reunion doing this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all these years, the wolves in sheep's clothing finally bare their fangs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected... they, they're attacking the Ursus troops!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why?! Challenging the Ursus government like this is basically suicide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, look at how fierce this attack is. This must have been a planned operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "The place we rescued Doctor from was supposed to be top secret... but they somehow still managed to infiltrate it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's possible that Reunion's attack has already spread through Chernobog in its entirety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... How, how can that be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shhhh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
